// Lab 11 - Elastic ES|QL (Windows integration / Winlogbeat security channel)
FROM logs-system.security-*, winlogbeat-*
| WHERE event.code == "4625" AND winlog.event_data.SubStatus IN ("0xc000006a", "0xc0000064")
| EVAL bucket = DATE_TRUNC(10 minutes, @timestamp)
| STATS failures = COUNT(*), distinct_accounts = COUNT_DISTINCT(winlog.event_data.TargetUserName) BY bucket, source.ip
| WHERE distinct_accounts >= 10
| SORT distinct_accounts DESC
